<title>BELGIUM: Generale Bank not ruling out NY listing.</title>
<headline>Generale Bank not ruling out NY listing.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian Generale Bank is not ruling out seeking a New York listing, but said it was not a priority despite the planned purchase of a U.S. fund manager.</p>
<p>&quot;I will never say no...but it's not a hot topic in the bank at the moment and there's certainly no decision as far as that is concerned,&quot; Generale Bank Managing Director Andre Bergen told a news conference on Wednesday on the purchase of Boston-based Harbor Capital Management Company Inc.</p>
<p>-- Nick Antonovics, Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6817, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
